# Agent-UI

Charter: `src/ui/AGENTS.md`. Spec: REQ-UI, REQ-SRV-DB (localStorage).

Allowed: `src/core/*`, DOM, CSS. Mount only under `#ui-root`.

Required screens: Main Menu, Settings, Highscores, Pause.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
import * as THREE from 'three'
tank.position.x  // 3D transform query

// ✅ VALID
EventBus.emit(Topics.GAME_START, { mode: 'PVE', mapId: 1, difficulty: 'EASY' })
localStorage.setItem('mta.masterVolume', String(masterVolume))
```

No Three.js loops. HUD values come from EventBus (`TANK_DAMAGED`, `ITEM_COLLECTED`). Radar is HTML/2D only.
